        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a small robot exploring a post-post apocalyptic world. Having awakened in a forest, explore the world to find clues as to what has happened, and discover replacement parts for yourself using tools, such as a foam gun and vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an overgrown landscape, and delve into the ruins of a forgotten world as you explore a post-post apocalyptic setting, searching for clues as to who you are and what happened</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Tools</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foam Gun - Spray foam onto walls to create platforms to help you navigate each level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum - With suction and blowing capabilities, find hidden keys and maneuverer over slippery surfaces and underwater </p>",
